WEBVTT

00:00:02.062 --> 00:00:05.862
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.134
Todoke Message

00:00:10.537 --> 00:00:19.468
'Itsudemo anato wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.247 --> 00:00:20.747
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.747 --> 00:00:28.789
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.789 --> 00:00:29.118
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.323 --> 00:00:36.525
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.897 --> 00:00:41.027
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.134 --> 00:00:45.127
Aruiteyuki koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.439 --> 00:00:49.535
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:53.111
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.447 --> 00:00:57.440
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.751 --> 00:01:01.585
Todoke Message

00:01:01.988 --> 00:01:10.088
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:14.466
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.868 --> 00:01:18.668
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.139 --> 00:01:28.571
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:35.450
The archives.
A building that sits in...

00:01:35.522 --> 00:01:38.685
...a quiet corner of the
Saiunkoku Palace grounds.

00:01:39.726 --> 00:01:42.695
It has absolutely no connection to the
central government administration.

00:01:42.996 --> 00:01:46.488
The job here, involving nothing more
than taking care of dusty books...

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:49.501
...is not known by many.

00:01:51.972 --> 00:01:53.030
Father.

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:55.073
Oh, Shurei.

00:01:55.609 --> 00:01:59.170
Shall we have some tea?
This is Mr. Ran Shuei.

00:01:59.479 --> 00:02:01.140
You know him, don't you?

00:02:01.848 --> 00:02:05.443
Why, of course!
Welcome, Your Maj... Mr. Shuei.

00:02:08.255 --> 00:02:10.689
G-Good day to you,
Lord Shoka.

00:02:11.892 --> 00:02:15.259
Now, let us prepare the tea,
Mr. Ran Shuei.

00:02:15.729 --> 00:02:17.253
R-Right.

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:20.629
I'll join you as soon as
I finish the work I'm doing.

00:02:21.535 --> 00:02:26.495
A Frog In the Well
Knows Not About the Ocean

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.464
Hey, Seiran.

00:02:30.477 --> 00:02:31.842
General Ran?

00:02:31.912 --> 00:02:33.379
Come here a moment.

00:02:38.285 --> 00:02:39.809
Who is this?

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:45.153
Koyu Ri. He's with the Department
of Civil Affairs. An old friend of mine.

00:02:45.225 --> 00:02:46.749
Who are you calling
your old friend?!

00:02:46.827 --> 00:02:48.795
We're no more than
mere acquaintances!

00:02:48.862 --> 00:02:51.126
Might you be the Assistant Secretary
of the Department?

00:02:51.198 --> 00:02:53.325
At sixteen,
the youngest ever to pass...

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.664
...the National Examinations,
with top marks?

00:02:56.002 --> 00:02:58.470
Way to go, Koyu.
You sure are famous.

00:02:59.005 --> 00:03:02.168
But don't you have official duties
in your department in the mornings?

00:03:02.242 --> 00:03:03.937
Why are you here
at the archives?

00:03:06.746 --> 00:03:10.614
In fact, we're both here on official duty.
Just like you are.

00:03:11.852 --> 00:03:13.114
You mean to say...?

00:03:13.487 --> 00:03:17.890
That's right. Like you, Koyu and I
have been assigned to the king.

00:03:18.291 --> 00:03:21.590
But we haven't had much to do
this whole month.

00:03:22.529 --> 00:03:25.327
You're Lady Shurei's family retainer,
are you not?

00:03:25.432 --> 00:03:26.592
Y-Yes.

00:03:26.933 --> 00:03:28.628
Since we both have nothing
better to do...

00:03:28.702 --> 00:03:30.932
...we've come to see how Lady Shurei,
the person you work for...

00:03:31.004 --> 00:03:33.302
...deals with the king.

00:03:34.274 --> 00:03:36.242
Here you are.
Go ahead.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:44.016
It's delicious.
So this is how it's supposed to taste.

00:03:44.951 --> 00:03:48.614
Have you always gone through the
trouble of drinking that "daddy tea"?

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.382
Daddy tea?

00:03:51.458 --> 00:03:54.450
The murderously bitter tea
that my father makes.

00:03:54.928 --> 00:03:58.420
Yes. But I like
Shoka's "daddy tea" too.

00:03:59.399 --> 00:04:01.128
He's a nice person.

00:04:01.835 --> 00:04:03.803
Do you come to the archives often?

00:04:04.237 --> 00:04:05.101
Yeah.

00:04:05.171 --> 00:04:06.900
Even though
you're a military officer?

00:04:09.743 --> 00:04:12.303
S-So you're Consort Hong,
aren't you?

00:04:12.879 --> 00:04:14.437
Oh, you knew?

00:04:14.514 --> 00:04:15.412
Yeah.

00:04:15.482 --> 00:04:17.973
I heard about it yesterday from Shisui
when I went to the Royal Residence.

00:04:18.051 --> 00:04:21.748
I see. So, why were
you at the Royal Residence?

00:04:22.622 --> 00:04:25.113
Well, I... um...!

00:04:25.458 --> 00:04:27.790
Could it be, a message from
His Majesty, perhaps?

00:04:27.928 --> 00:04:30.055
Um... well, ah...!

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:32.154
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:32.966 --> 00:04:35.730
P-Please! Lord Shoka!
Have some tea!

00:04:38.138 --> 00:04:40.698
Shurei, you're a princess
of the Hong Family, right?

00:04:41.241 --> 00:04:45.575
So why are you so good at making
sweets like this? And also, those...!

00:04:48.615 --> 00:04:50.082
These hands?

00:04:51.184 --> 00:04:54.847
They're all chapped. They're not at all
like the hands of a princess.

00:04:54.921 --> 00:04:58.789
Actually, they've become a lot nicer
since I entered the Royal Palace.

00:04:58.959 --> 00:05:00.517
We're very poor.

00:05:01.094 --> 00:05:04.530
So I've had to work hard
every day.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.430
And that's why my hands aren't
as fair and smooth...

00:05:09.502 --> 00:05:11.629
...as the hands of a princess.

00:05:13.907 --> 00:05:15.738
But you know,
I really don't mind.

00:05:15.809 --> 00:05:20.007
It's all so the three of us, my father,
Seiran and myself, can live together.

00:05:20.413 --> 00:05:21.880
So I don't mind this.

00:05:22.082 --> 00:05:23.140
Seiran?

00:05:23.216 --> 00:05:25.047
Perhaps you've met
him somewhere.

00:05:25.285 --> 00:05:27.947
Because he was assigned to
His Majesty and the Left Urin Army.

00:05:30.123 --> 00:05:33.217
Dropping crumbs all over the place.
You're like a child.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:35.828
I'm already nineteen!
I'm not a child!

00:05:36.062 --> 00:05:39.395
Oh? Is that so?
Then you're the same age as the king.

00:05:42.836 --> 00:05:45.100
Huh? How many of those
did you eat?

00:05:45.505 --> 00:05:47.097
Five or six, maybe?

00:05:47.841 --> 00:05:48.705
Ow!

00:05:48.775 --> 00:05:50.174
That's too many!

00:05:50.243 --> 00:05:53.576
I'll wrap them up for you, so take them
with you and eat them later.

00:05:54.914 --> 00:05:57.781
Shurei is like
a nagging mother, isn't she?

00:05:58.218 --> 00:05:59.082
Yes.

00:05:59.152 --> 00:06:00.414
Father!

00:06:01.354 --> 00:06:02.514
Sorry about that.

00:06:04.457 --> 00:06:07.017
But this is nice. This sorta thing.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:17.937
Why, that's...!

00:06:22.809 --> 00:06:26.108
It seems that the rumor
about his preference for men is true.

00:06:26.346 --> 00:06:29.474
Lady Shurei. What are you doing
in a place like this?

00:06:29.549 --> 00:06:32.382
Oh, it's you, Seiran.
You startled me!

00:06:33.219 --> 00:06:35.414
Are you unhappy that His Majesty
doesn't come to spend...

00:06:35.488 --> 00:06:37.115
...his nights with you?

00:06:37.223 --> 00:06:39.885
D-Don't be ridiculous!
I was just...!

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.452
Just?

00:06:42.529 --> 00:06:46.056
I was just wondering,
if maybe he is actually quite lonely.

00:06:46.933 --> 00:06:48.423
That's what I thought.

00:06:50.537 --> 00:06:53.529
When I first met him,
and I asked for his name...

00:06:53.606 --> 00:06:55.574
...what do you think he said?

00:06:55.775 --> 00:06:57.242
He said it's "Shuei Ran".

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.572
Interesting.

00:06:58.778 --> 00:07:02.942
Wandering the palace wearing loose,
non-governmental clothing...

00:07:03.049 --> 00:07:05.916
...he's practically advertising
the fact that he's the king.

00:07:06.619 --> 00:07:08.610
My Lady, what are those books?

00:07:09.189 --> 00:07:12.488
Oh these?
I'm going to do some studying.

00:07:13.259 --> 00:07:18.458
I entered the palace as a tutor
to the king, so I need to be prepared.

00:07:19.599 --> 00:07:22.090
I assumed he was a hopeless,
stupid lord.

00:07:22.702 --> 00:07:25.068
But talking to him,
I realized he's not at all like that.

00:07:25.138 --> 00:07:29.097
He's strangely childish, but he's neither
short-tempered nor arrogant.

00:07:29.442 --> 00:07:32.377
What's more, he listens closely
to what I have to say.

00:07:32.879 --> 00:07:34.506
If he listens
to what people have to say...

00:07:34.581 --> 00:07:36.378
...I feel I could get through
to him with words.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.875
He's not as bad
as I had imagined.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:43.153
On the contrary,
I'm sure he'll make a good king.

00:07:43.923 --> 00:07:46.323
Yes, I think so too.

00:07:46.793 --> 00:07:48.727
And that's why I need to study.

00:07:55.468 --> 00:07:56.526
Advisor Sho!

00:07:57.537 --> 00:07:59.801
Oh, Lady Shurei.

00:07:59.906 --> 00:08:02.397
I have a favor to ask of you,
Advisor Sho.

00:08:02.509 --> 00:08:03.476
What is it?

00:08:03.543 --> 00:08:08.105
I would like to study. But I find
reading books on my own isn't enough.

00:08:08.181 --> 00:08:10.979
So I was hoping you
could introduce me to a teacher.

00:08:11.284 --> 00:08:14.811
Oh, very well.
Leave it to me, then.

00:08:18.291 --> 00:08:21.055
Let us start with the fundamental
structure of the Court.

00:08:21.227 --> 00:08:25.061
Lady Shurei, I heard that you came
to the palace at Advisor Sho's request.

00:08:25.465 --> 00:08:26.432
Yes.

00:08:26.499 --> 00:08:30.060
Then I assume you have
a certain level of knowledge.

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:32.704
So, can you tell me the four ministries
and six departments?

00:08:32.772 --> 00:08:35.536
The four ministries are the ministries
of State Affairs, the Chancellery...

00:08:35.608 --> 00:08:38.478
Four Ministries/Enlightened Ones' Cave/
Secretariat/Chancellery/State Affairs
...the Secretariat,
and the Enlightened Ones' Cave.

00:08:38.478 --> 00:08:38.645
Four Ministries/Enlightened Ones' Cave/
Secretariat/Chancellery/State Affairs

00:08:38.645 --> 00:08:41.514
Four Ministries/Enlightened Ones' Cave/
Secretariat/Chancellery/State Affairs
The six departments under the Ministry
of State Affairs are the departments of...

00:08:41.514 --> 00:08:41.614
Six Departments/Public Works/Justice/
Military/Protocol/Finance/Civil Affairs
The six departments under the Ministry
of State Affairs are the departments of...

00:08:41.614 --> 00:08:41.648
Six Departments/Public Works/Justice/
Military/Protocol/Finance/Civil Affairs

00:08:41.648 --> 00:08:45.448
Six Departments/Public Works/Justice/
Military/Protocol/Finance/Civil Affairs
...Civil Affairs, Finance, Protocol,
Military, Justice and Public Works.

00:08:46.085 --> 00:08:47.712
You know quite a bit.

00:08:47.787 --> 00:08:50.187
In fact, I've always wanted
to take the National Exams...

00:08:50.256 --> 00:08:52.952
...so I studied constantly
under my father's guidance.

00:08:53.026 --> 00:08:55.893
But after learning that women
can't take the exams...

00:08:55.962 --> 00:08:59.591
...I passed that dream on to the children
and taught at the local temple.

00:09:00.466 --> 00:09:02.730
So you were a teacher?

00:09:02.802 --> 00:09:03.666
Yes.

00:09:03.736 --> 00:09:07.228
Then there isn't much left
for you to learn.

00:09:07.674 --> 00:09:10.108
No, that's not true.

00:09:10.977 --> 00:09:15.243
I don't believe there is such a thing
as a limit to learning.

00:09:20.954 --> 00:09:22.922
By the way, General Ran.

00:09:23.022 --> 00:09:26.253
You're a military officer, right?
So why are you giving lectures?

00:09:26.359 --> 00:09:30.022
Oh. Well, that's because...
He's here at last.

00:09:32.999 --> 00:09:34.261
Mr. Koyu?

00:09:34.534 --> 00:09:40.200
Lost your way again? I was just thinking
about taking your place teaching.

00:09:40.273 --> 00:09:41.968
Shut up!

00:09:42.175 --> 00:09:44.268
Although you could say
he's a genius...

00:09:44.344 --> 00:09:48.644
...he has no sense of direction,
and can get lost within thirty steps.

00:09:49.349 --> 00:09:50.816
No sense of direction?

00:09:50.884 --> 00:09:52.909
Will you quit blabbing
and shut up?!

00:09:54.187 --> 00:09:56.155
Your student is waiting for you.

00:09:57.423 --> 00:09:58.981
Thank you for your assistance!

00:10:00.894 --> 00:10:04.591
So you were serious when you said
you want to study for this country's sake.

00:10:04.664 --> 00:10:07.098
In comparison,
that stupid king...!

00:10:07.367 --> 00:10:08.834
Stupid king...!

00:10:09.302 --> 00:10:11.862
This palace is large,
yet small.

00:10:11.938 --> 00:10:13.906
If it's small,
why do you get lost?

00:10:14.007 --> 00:10:18.376
Shut up! What I'm trying to say is that
the king doesn't know anything yet!

00:10:18.478 --> 00:10:20.343
Yet here's a woman who's
keen to learn...

00:10:20.413 --> 00:10:22.404
...because she's worried
about the country!

00:10:22.482 --> 00:10:23.676
Don't get all worked up
just because...

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:26.116
...the stupid king
doesn't give you any work.

00:10:26.185 --> 00:10:27.345
Um...!

00:10:27.887 --> 00:10:28.819
What is it?

00:10:28.888 --> 00:10:34.588
The stupid king... I mean, His Majesty.
Has he ever left the palace grounds?

00:10:34.961 --> 00:10:37.122
I'm not too certain,
but it's unlikely.

00:10:37.597 --> 00:10:39.462
You, on the other hand...

00:10:39.532 --> 00:10:42.433
...often slip out to a certain district
to have fun with the women.

00:10:42.502 --> 00:10:44.629
Why not join me next time?

00:10:44.704 --> 00:10:45.932
No, thank you!

00:10:46.005 --> 00:10:48.803
"A frog in the well
knows not about the ocean."

00:10:49.609 --> 00:10:52.203
However stupid the king,
if he sees the broader world...

00:10:52.278 --> 00:10:55.042
...it could arouse interest
within him to govern.

00:11:01.988 --> 00:11:04.479
Shurei, your home is near here?

00:11:04.557 --> 00:11:05.717
Yes, that's right.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:10.154
Wow, this place sure is lively.

00:11:10.663 --> 00:11:12.927
There are various kinds
of shops in this area.

00:11:12.999 --> 00:11:16.025
Naturally there's food,
but there are also antiques, décor...

00:11:16.102 --> 00:11:19.071
...clothing, books...
you can find anything here.

00:11:21.541 --> 00:11:23.270
Mister, I'll have two of these!

00:11:24.277 --> 00:11:25.574
Here you go.

00:11:26.379 --> 00:11:27.869
You'll have one too, right?

00:11:34.787 --> 00:11:36.118
This is good!

00:11:36.222 --> 00:11:37.314
Isn't it?

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:43.087
This is the first time I've ever eaten
while walking. This isn't bad at all.

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:48.758
Wait for me!

00:11:49.535 --> 00:11:50.900
Miss Shurei!

00:11:52.405 --> 00:11:53.599
Ryushin!

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:56.299
Where have you been lately?

00:11:56.542 --> 00:11:58.237
Well, I've been busy.

00:11:59.045 --> 00:12:01.275
Um, Miss Shurei,
where's Seiran?

00:12:01.948 --> 00:12:03.916
Who's this flamboyant guy?

00:12:05.151 --> 00:12:07.119
Oops! He's right.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:10.849
F-Flamboyant?
Y-You think so?

00:12:15.762 --> 00:12:19.220
Guess it doesn't matter if you're
not Seiran. Hey, let's play together!

00:12:20.366 --> 00:12:22.334
Uh, wait! H-Hey!

00:12:23.369 --> 00:12:24.802
Miss Shurei!

00:12:26.539 --> 00:12:28.336
Kinren's in trouble!

00:12:28.741 --> 00:12:29.708
What?!

00:12:30.076 --> 00:12:35.036
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:12:35.481 --> 00:12:39.110
A lousy comb like this costs
that much?! Don't screw with me!

00:12:39.218 --> 00:12:40.583
B-But...!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.811
This piece is made from
real boxwood...

00:12:43.923 --> 00:12:46.050
...and even so,
it is very reasonably priced.

00:12:46.692 --> 00:12:48.717
A person can say whatever
they like!

00:12:48.795 --> 00:12:51.423
That's true. A person can say
whatever they like.

00:12:51.497 --> 00:12:52.589
What?!

00:12:53.699 --> 00:12:56.133
You're saying you can't see the fine
craftsmanship in this piece?

00:12:56.202 --> 00:12:58.329
You must be blind.

00:12:58.404 --> 00:12:59.666
What did you say?!

00:12:59.772 --> 00:13:01.205
If you keep on like this...

00:13:01.274 --> 00:13:03.799
...it's only gonna reveal just how
tasteless you are.

00:13:03.876 --> 00:13:05.639
Are you okay with that?

00:13:11.617 --> 00:13:13.551
Teacher Shurei!
Thank you!

00:13:13.786 --> 00:13:17.517
Not at all. More importantly,
how's your mother?

00:13:18.658 --> 00:13:21.957
Well, she's been sick in bed
with a cold since this morning.

00:13:22.128 --> 00:13:24.119
So that's why you're
taking care of the shop.

00:13:25.865 --> 00:13:27.924
I know!
I have a great idea!

00:13:32.038 --> 00:13:33.801
Thank you, Teacher Shurei!

00:13:34.574 --> 00:13:38.271
Just leave the shop to the two of us
and go look after your mother, okay?

00:13:38.377 --> 00:13:39.469
Yes!

00:13:41.681 --> 00:13:43.842
All right!
Let's make lots of money!

00:13:45.118 --> 00:13:47.985
Welcome!
How about a hairpin?!

00:13:50.189 --> 00:13:52.054
Come on!
You call out, too!

00:13:52.258 --> 00:13:54.556
Me? Ah, you're asking me to?

00:13:54.627 --> 00:13:57.755
That's right.
Who else is there here? Go on.

00:13:58.331 --> 00:14:00.060
W-W-Welcome.

00:14:00.133 --> 00:14:01.498
Say it louder!

00:14:01.567 --> 00:14:03.330
Welcome!

00:14:03.836 --> 00:14:05.599
My, what a good-looking man.

00:14:06.239 --> 00:14:09.504
Welcome!
How about this hairpin for you?

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:13.337
My, that looks quite nice.

00:14:13.646 --> 00:14:15.876
I'll give you a special discount.

00:14:16.415 --> 00:14:20.613
Would you like to try it on?
Here, put it in her hair.

00:14:23.623 --> 00:14:25.113
L-Like this?

00:14:25.191 --> 00:14:26.556
It's beautiful!

00:14:27.293 --> 00:14:29.261
It suits you very well!

00:14:29.328 --> 00:14:31.660
Ow! I-It suits you well!

00:14:31.964 --> 00:14:33.591
Y-You think so?

00:14:34.167 --> 00:14:35.259
Yes.

00:14:37.036 --> 00:14:39.027
In that case, I'll take one.

00:14:40.072 --> 00:14:41.539
Thank you very much!

00:14:45.545 --> 00:14:48.605
It's so great having such
a good-looking guy put it in for me.

00:14:48.748 --> 00:14:50.272
Me too! Me too!

00:14:50.349 --> 00:14:51.714
Choose one for me, too!

00:14:52.151 --> 00:14:55.917
Okay, now! No pushing!
No pushing! Wait your turn!

00:14:58.724 --> 00:15:02.956
The king is selling things. Punishment
for using my name, perhaps?

00:15:04.197 --> 00:15:05.494
That's Seiran!

00:15:06.165 --> 00:15:07.928
He's a true bodyguard.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.969
Watching over the king without
being too close or too far away.

00:15:12.371 --> 00:15:15.534
I can't wait for the day you finally
meet the king in person.

00:15:15.608 --> 00:15:19.044
I'll be sure to give him
a piece of my mind when I do.

00:15:20.246 --> 00:15:22.214
We earned quite a bit,
didn't we?

00:15:22.548 --> 00:15:26.279
This should take care of the cost of
medicine for Kinren's mom for a while.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:29.048
Are you tired?

00:15:30.056 --> 00:15:32.923
No. How should I put it?
Well, I had fun.

00:15:33.659 --> 00:15:37.755
I'm glad to hear that.
It's a wonderful thing to help others.

00:15:39.865 --> 00:15:41.833
To help others...!

00:15:43.803 --> 00:15:45.498
This is my home.

00:15:52.511 --> 00:15:54.376
You really are poor.

00:15:54.447 --> 00:15:56.278
That's not very nice.

00:15:56.549 --> 00:15:58.016
S-Sorry.

00:15:58.651 --> 00:16:01.017
It's okay.
It's the truth, after all.

00:16:05.458 --> 00:16:08.621
So Shurei. You were a teacher
to the children.

00:16:08.961 --> 00:16:10.019
That's right.

00:16:10.296 --> 00:16:14.027
You're so energetic.
And you're good at selling things, too.

00:16:17.303 --> 00:16:18.964
Are those cherry trees?

00:16:19.372 --> 00:16:23.103
Yes, they are. Our cherry trees
don't blossom any more.

00:16:23.175 --> 00:16:24.699
Not for eight years now.

00:16:25.344 --> 00:16:26.709
Eight years?

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:30.080
Eight years ago, when there was
that struggle for the throne.

00:16:30.149 --> 00:16:31.878
After the king collapsed...

00:16:31.951 --> 00:16:33.543
...the Court's administration
was thrown into disarray...

00:16:33.619 --> 00:16:35.382
...with the fight for the throne.

00:16:36.422 --> 00:16:39.983
Those of us living outside the castle
walls got hit badly in the aftermath.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:44.058
Many aristocrats
closed their gates firmly...

00:16:45.064 --> 00:16:48.192
...and the dead bodies of those who
starved littered the front of the gates.

00:16:48.267 --> 00:16:49.894
Father and Seiran
did what they could...

00:16:49.969 --> 00:16:51.800
...to help the people
get by in those hard times...

00:16:51.871 --> 00:16:53.270
...but there was little
that we could do.

00:16:53.339 --> 00:16:56.035
Probably, the most help we could
offer the people was our garden.

00:16:56.642 --> 00:16:59.770
We had many fruit-bearing trees
and our pond was large...

00:17:00.346 --> 00:17:03.941
...so we were able to share our fruit
and fish with the townspeople.

00:17:04.917 --> 00:17:08.148
As a result, there isn't
a single fish left in the pond...

00:17:08.654 --> 00:17:11.521
...and it'll be years before
the trees bear fruit again.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:15.583
Think about it.
Not even the flowers bloom.

00:17:16.362 --> 00:17:18.091
Because we ate everything.

00:17:20.466 --> 00:17:23.128
Many people died
right before my eyes.

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:29.634
Shurei, would you please play
your erhu for this child's sake?

00:17:30.109 --> 00:17:32.168
So that he may rest in peace?

00:17:32.678 --> 00:17:36.546
Day after day, I played the erhu
more times than I could count.

00:17:37.416 --> 00:17:39.384
It was as if we were alive
only to die.

00:17:41.787 --> 00:17:45.450
Why did we have to live only to
experience what we went through?

00:17:46.092 --> 00:17:49.061
Father and Seiran got thinner
with each passing day.

00:17:49.562 --> 00:17:51.530
I was so scared.

00:17:52.832 --> 00:17:56.461
Every night, I dreamt of them dying,
leaving me behind, all alone.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.961
Those were dreadful
days of terror.

00:18:01.073 --> 00:18:03.041
Shurei.

00:18:03.809 --> 00:18:05.777
That's why
I entered the palace.

00:18:07.313 --> 00:18:11.477
I've had enough of being unable to do
anything but cry over my helplessness.

00:18:11.751 --> 00:18:15.949
That's why, next time, if there's
anything at all I can do, I want to do it.

00:18:17.623 --> 00:18:20.091
What I'm hoping for
isn't really that much.

00:18:20.926 --> 00:18:23.417
I don't intend to say
anything as foolish as...

00:18:23.496 --> 00:18:26.693
..."please build a country where
everyone can live happily".

00:18:27.967 --> 00:18:31.494
Because happiness and
unhappiness are up to the individual.

00:18:31.604 --> 00:18:34.937
So the king shouldn't have to
take responsibility for that.

00:18:35.474 --> 00:18:38.443
A person's life
is up to that person.

00:18:38.677 --> 00:18:42.044
They should choose their own path
from the many options they have.

00:18:43.082 --> 00:18:44.947
Choose their own path...!

00:18:45.584 --> 00:18:49.179
There are times, though,
when a person isn't able to choose.

00:18:49.722 --> 00:18:52.850
If it's due to a natural disaster,
then there's no choice but to give in.

00:18:52.958 --> 00:18:55.950
But problems caused by man
should be preventable, right?

00:18:56.695 --> 00:18:58.287
And that's why
you entered the palace?

00:18:58.931 --> 00:19:03.197
Because there are many things that
people can do to make things work out.

00:19:03.869 --> 00:19:06.201
Yet, there are things
the average citizen can't do...

00:19:06.272 --> 00:19:08.206
...regardless of how hard they try.

00:19:08.474 --> 00:19:10.840
And that's the king's job.
To take care of such things. Isn't it?

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.811
But if the king slacks off, then who's
going to take care of those things?

00:19:17.249 --> 00:19:19.774
I don't know why you don't take care
of your governmental duties...

00:19:19.852 --> 00:19:22.514
...but it can't be avoided
now that you've taken the throne.

00:19:22.788 --> 00:19:24.653
You'll just have to
do your best.

00:19:25.224 --> 00:19:28.216
In exchange, I intend
to do my best with you.

00:19:30.296 --> 00:19:34.323
If you've never studied politics, being the
youngest prince, then I'll study with you.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:36.095
When you're feeling insecure,
I'll stay by your side.

00:19:36.168 --> 00:19:37.965
If you wanna complain,
I'll listen to you as much as you want.

00:19:38.037 --> 00:19:40.528
And if you wanna cry,
go ahead and cry.

00:19:40.606 --> 00:19:45.669
I'm not an official, so there's
no need to put up a brave front.

00:19:46.712 --> 00:19:51.274
I didn't come here to bear your child
or merely to scold you.

00:19:52.351 --> 00:19:54.410
I came to give you my support.

00:19:54.487 --> 00:19:57.923
I'm here to stand by your side and
support you as you stand up as king!

00:20:00.726 --> 00:20:03.661
Well, that's what I want to say
to the king when I meet him.

00:20:04.129 --> 00:20:06.029
But I haven't been able to.

00:20:06.398 --> 00:20:10.528
Since you personally know the king,
would you tell him what I just said?

00:20:10.803 --> 00:20:16.400
And if he's interested, I'll be waiting
in the archives tomorrow afternoon.

00:20:21.847 --> 00:20:24.475
All right. I'll be sure
to pass on the message.

00:20:30.022 --> 00:20:32.149
The tea's... become cold.

00:20:32.758 --> 00:20:34.225
I'll go make some more.

00:20:41.867 --> 00:20:42.959
My Lady.

00:20:47.139 --> 00:20:48.606
Seiran.

00:20:55.214 --> 00:20:57.182
You really hung in there.

00:20:58.517 --> 00:21:02.476
Just remembering what happened then,
eight years ago...

00:21:02.555 --> 00:21:04.523
...must have been very hard for you.

00:21:13.198 --> 00:21:15.291
I'm sorry.
I'm fine now.

00:21:16.068 --> 00:21:19.299
I'm sure the king will come
to the archives tomorrow.

00:21:34.019 --> 00:21:35.816
We are known as Ryuki Shi.

00:21:36.589 --> 00:21:39.422
We received a message
from a man who knows us well.

00:21:40.192 --> 00:21:44.959
Yes. And, your reply?

00:21:46.098 --> 00:21:47.963
Let's govern.

00:21:50.269 --> 00:21:51.463
Thank you!

00:22:02.014 --> 00:22:03.982
Can I ask you one question?

00:22:04.049 --> 00:22:04.708
What?

00:22:04.783 --> 00:22:08.719
Y-You prefer men
over women, right?

00:22:11.757 --> 00:22:12.883
Well, yeah.

00:22:14.860 --> 00:22:16.953
Th-That's what I thought. Good.

00:22:17.663 --> 00:22:22.691
W-Well, there's the issue of successors,
but we can think about that later.

00:22:22.768 --> 00:22:25.828
F-For now, let's study the basics
of governmental administration.

00:22:30.209 --> 00:22:32.507
Let me introduce you to your teacher!

00:22:32.945 --> 00:22:37.678
It's an honor to finally meet you,
Your Majesty. I am Koyu Ri.

00:22:39.418 --> 00:22:41.352
Please do your best,
Your Majesty.

00:22:41.787 --> 00:22:43.755
Shuei Ran.
What are you doing here?

00:22:43.956 --> 00:22:46.925
It has always been my duty
to guard Your Majesty.

00:22:47.259 --> 00:22:48.749
What's more, I heard that someone
in the archives...

00:22:48.827 --> 00:22:50.385
...has been using my name...

00:22:50.462 --> 00:22:52.794
...so I've come
to check things out.

00:22:54.833 --> 00:22:59.133
From now on, I'll be giving you
intensive lessons. Be prepared.

00:22:59.304 --> 00:23:01.295
I-I look forward to it.

00:23:02.341 --> 00:23:05.139
So, His Majesty has finally
taken an interest in things!

00:23:05.277 --> 00:23:07.472
Looks like bringing Lady Shurei
and her knowledge of...

00:23:07.546 --> 00:23:10.037
...ordinary citizens into the palace
was the right thing to do.

00:23:10.449 --> 00:23:13.316
Sho, it was a splendid idea,
considering it came from you.

00:23:13.852 --> 00:23:15.979
That last "from you" bit
was unnecessary.

00:23:16.221 --> 00:23:18.018
Now, the question is...

00:23:18.090 --> 00:23:20.888
...whether His Majesty
will give Koyu Ri...

00:23:20.959 --> 00:23:22.790
...and Shuei Ran a flower or not.

00:23:30.636 --> 00:23:35.733
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.941 --> 00:23:42.278
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.581 --> 00:23:47.541
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.753 --> 00:23:52.850
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.859 --> 00:23:58.262
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.798 --> 00:24:04.929
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.704 --> 00:24:16.273
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.149 --> 00:24:22.746
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.155 --> 00:24:28.218
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:29.094 --> 00:24:34.657
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:35.033 --> 00:24:41.905
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.144 --> 00:24:45.544
Next Episode

00:24:45.544 --> 00:24:47.746
Next Episode
I'm thinking Ryuki's the type who...

00:24:47.746 --> 00:24:48.147
Next Episode

00:24:48.147 --> 00:24:50.816
Next Episode
The Capable Falcon Hides Its Talons
...if he puts his mind to it,
can do pretty much anything.

00:24:50.816 --> 00:24:50.849
Next Episode
The Capable Falcon Hides Its Talons

00:24:50.849 --> 00:24:52.317
Next Episode
The Capable Falcon Hides Its Talons
I've changed my mind about him a bit.

00:24:52.317 --> 00:24:52.351
Next Episode
The Capable Falcon Hides Its Talons

00:24:52.351 --> 00:24:54.153
Next Episode
The Capable Falcon Hides Its Talons
Don't get ahead of yourself!
I said "a bit".

00:24:54.153 --> 00:24:54.186
Next Episode
The Capable Falcon Hides Its Talons

00:24:54.186 --> 00:24:54.853
Next Episode
The Capable Falcon Hides Its Talons
So what are you doing in my room?
I said, don't get ahead of yourself!

00:24:54.853 --> 00:24:56.753
So what are you doing in my room?
I said, don't get ahead of yourself!
